## Voices in the margin

> Simplicity is the soul of efficiency. A theme with nine colours and three fonts beats a palette with nine hundred options.
>
> — *Ancient proverb of the build pipeline*

## Data in tables

| Token              | Role        | Example            |
| ------------------ | ----------- | ------------------ |
| `--base`           | Background  | Page canvas        |
| `--alt`            | Surface     | Cards, code, tables |
| `--prose`          | Text        | Paragraphs         |
| `--accent`         | Interaction | Links, highlights  |
| `--pop`            | Emphasis    | Badges, standouts  |

## Status callouts

Each variant carries its own icon badge, border tint and surface — so state is readable at a glance, not just by hue.

